\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li495\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  We thank you God each passing day,\cf0 
\par \pard\li495\sl190\slmult0\tab For good things He bestows on us;
\par \tab We beseech our loving Father,
\par \tab To remember us in our distress
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li495\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      2.  He gives us His good news always
\par \pard\li495\sl190\slmult0\tab And it satisfies us always
\par \tab O God of righteousness, give us
\par \tab Eternal life now and always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li495\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      3. We thank you O Lord Jesus Christ,
\par \pard\li495\sl190\slmult0\tab You've come a stranger among us,
\par \tab You, living Bread of truthfulness,
\par \tab Dwell in us that we shall not want.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

